{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-577699543798252048 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=577699543697588752&sectionId=577699543798252048)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrpx59fHRV_text","label":"ggrpx59fHRV_text","default":"Seen Us in the News? Here’s the Truth."},{"type":"html","id":"ggX2ilwSika_text","label":"ggX2ilwSika_text","default":"<p>Over the past few months, some of our longtime customers reached out, sending us a news article that mentioned <i>Wellness Nest</i> in connection with recent viral Shilajit promotions online.</p><p>To be honest, we were just as surprised as you.</p><p>While we were not involved in the type of advertising discussed<a href=\"https://www.20minutes.fr/sante/4164819-20250726-shilajit-comment-pubs-produit-miracle-usurpent-identite-personnalites-grace-ia\"> in the article</a>, we believe in addressing things openly. So, if you’ve seen our name come up lately and wondered what’s going on, this blog is for you</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDcHO_tkDQ_text","label":"ggDcHO_tkDQ_text","default":"<strong>We’re Growing Fast. But Not at Any Cost.&nbsp;</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK3gVMcqwg_text","label":"ggK3gVMcqwg_text","default":"<p>Wellness Nest has never used AI-generated content, never paid celebrities, and never claimed our Shilajit can cure or treat any medical condition.</p><p>What we’ve done is focus on product quality, service, and customer trust—day in, day out. That’s what created the momentum we’re seeing today.</p><p>As our community grows, more content creators and affiliates have started sharing their experience with Wellness Nest. While we truly appreciate the support, we’ve also noticed that <i>some promotions go too far</i>.</p><p>We want to be clear: <strong>Wellness Nest has a strict affiliate policy and detailed guidelines on how our products should be promoted</strong>—including what not to say. Overclaiming, misleading benefits, or referencing unverified medical outcomes is strictly against our terms.</p><p>Whenever we identify a violation, <strong>we reach out to the creators directly and ask them to take the content down.</strong> That said, we are a small team—and unfortunately, we cannot control or monitor affiliates all around the world.</p><p>We’re doing our best. And we’re committed to doing even better.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRW3usuVC5_text","label":"ggRW3usuVC5_text","default":"<strong>We Do Not Claim to Cure, Treat, or&nbsp;Prevent Illness</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoAjh0P7ti_text","label":"ggoAjh0P7ti_text","default":"<p>Let’s be upfront: We are fully compliant with FDA guidelines and have <strong>never stated that our products can cure or treat</strong> any disease or medical condition.</p><p>If you’ve seen videos or posts claiming otherwise, they were not made or endorsed by us.</p><p>Every Wellness Nest product includes appropriate disclaimers, and we work hard to ensure ethical, transparent communication at every step.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggD7HbNeyfX_text","label":"ggD7HbNeyfX_text","default":"<strong>Why Are People Promoting Wellness Nest So Aggressively?</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxD5F8ssSO_text","label":"ggxD5F8ssSO_text","default":"<p><strong>Honestly? Because the product delivers.</strong></p><p>Here’s what many in our community already know—and why some people are eager to spread the word (even too eagerly at times):</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggf9MTvzw3a_text","label":"ggf9MTvzw3a_text","default":"1. <strong>Outstanding Customer Service</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbn0IJNKvH_text","label":"ggbn0IJNKvH_text","default":"<p>We care about every person who shops with us. Our support team is responsive, kind, and always willing to help—whether it’s a delivery question or dosage guidance. That level of care builds loyalty.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKj7A5zPP8_text","label":"ggKj7A5zPP8_text","default":"2. <strong>Real Results Backed by Real Stories</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5udQhRdV_text","label":"ggL5udQhRdV_text","default":"<p>Our Shilajit works. Customers report improvements in energy, stamina, clarity, and overall wellness. We don’t exaggerate—<i>we listen to them.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmuN1vgbHo_text","label":"ggmuN1vgbHo_text","default":"3. <strong>Third-Party Lab Testing for Every Batch</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg92Engm-Vw_text","label":"gg92Engm-Vw_text","default":"<p>Every single batch is tested by <strong>Eurofins</strong>, a world-class third-party lab.</p><ul><li>Tested for heavy metals</li><li>Tested for purity and potency</li><li>Verified documentation available</li></ul><p>We don’t just claim quality—we prove it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIMycOvou4_text","label":"ggIMycOvou4_text","default":"<strong>What We Don’t Support: Hype, Gimmicks, or Misinformation</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFJeTDTG7k_text","label":"ggFJeTDTG7k_text","default":"<p>We’ve seen the AI-generated videos circulating, and while we don’t control who uses our name, we absolutely <strong>do not condone</strong> this style of promotion.</p><p>This is a good moment to say clearly:</p><ul><li>We do not use deepfakes.</li><li>We do not impersonate public figures.</li><li>We do not pay influencers or celebrities to make wild claims.</li></ul><p>Our marketing remains rooted in honesty. Because <strong>trust is everything</strong>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnoRI-W89W_text","label":"ggnoRI-W89W_text","default":"<strong>If This Is Your First Time Hearing About Us—Welcome.</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7MliK7S5L_text","label":"gg7MliK7S5L_text","default":"<p>We’re not here to ride a trend. We’re here to build a relationship—with you.</p><p>If you’re just discovering Wellness Nest through the noise, thank you for giving us your time and attention. And if you’ve been with us since the beginning, we’re more grateful than ever for your support.</p><p>Our mission remains the same:</p><p><strong>To deliver the highest-quality, cleanest, most authentic Shilajit—grounded in science, tradition, and care.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-EzSCI3TY_label","label":"gg-EzSCI3TY_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-EzSCI3TY_outOfStockLabel","label":"gg-EzSCI3TY_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-EzSCI3TY_unavailableLabel","label":"gg-EzSCI3TY_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-EzSCI3TY_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"gg-EzSCI3TY_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggT0UAhBQgS_text","label":"ggT0UAhBQgS_text","default":"<strong>Let’s Keep It Honest, Always.</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg70EB5CKKh_text","label":"gg70EB5CKKh_text","default":"<p>We believe in the power of wellness—but not in selling fantasies.</p><p>If you have any questions about what you’ve seen online, about our sourcing, our testing, or even the article in question - just reach out. We’ll always answer you with transparency and respect.</p><p>Thank you again for considering Wellness Nest.</p><p>We’re here to serve, not sell stories.</p><p><strong>— The Wellness Nest Team</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSoee7N0d5_text","label":"ggSoee7N0d5_text","default":"Related posts"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBPa3AoeHL_text","label":"ggBPa3AoeHL_text","default":"<p><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/blogs/news/1-introduction-to-shilajit-history-origins-and-cultural-significance-in-ayurveda?_ab=0&amp;key=1717959064799\">Introduction to Shilajit: History, origins, and cultural significance in Ayurveda</a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOjRyedA18_text","label":"ggOjRyedA18_text","default":"<p><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/blogs/news/what-is-ayurveda-principles-of-ayurvedic-medicine-and-its-holistic-approach?_ab=0&amp;key=1717959067154\">What is Ayurveda? Principles of Ayurvedic Medicine and Its Holistic Approach</a></p>"}],
